{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e88dd6006945d28099e3","chatId":"a10ed722f446472db3fd5aecd7c6fb54","sessionId":null,"userId":67794,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":990,"promptTokens":1502,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:17"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909191027769663,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e88dd6006945d28099e1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369677547,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:17","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e88dd6006945d28099e1","chatId":"a10ed722f446472db3fd5aecd7c6fb54","sessionId":null,"userId":67794,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n艾伯特和他爸爸达成了一项协议。如果艾伯特成功毕业并进入学校的前5名，他爸爸会给他买一台新的笔记本电脑。如果艾伯特失败，那么他将一无所获。在公布名单时，艾伯特没有进入前5名，而只排名第6。第二天，他们发现前5名中的一名选手因为作弊被取消资格。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，艾伯特最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 嫉妒\nB) 尴尬\nC) 紧张\nD) 惊喜\nE) 反对\nF) 愧疚\n\n## 问题 2\n艾伯特为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 虽然他最初对自己的失败感到失望，但是被取消资格的选手让他进入了前五，使他赢了赌注\nB) 他证明了他的父亲是对的\nC) 他的父亲准备给他买一台新的笔记本电脑\nD) 他被评为前六名的艾伯特","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909191027769663,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e88dd6006945d28099e3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369677544,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:17","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"0052ca82d3314cb6abbf9978b2d0ca75"}